	                   |                        |                              |  exact keyword        |
	                   |                        |                              |  tokens.              |
	-------------------|------------------------|------------------------------|-----------------------|
	Hybrid             | Executes sparse and    | Production enterprise RAG    |❇️ Delivers the         |
	(Ensemble)         | dense searches in      | systems, specialized legal,  |  highest collective   |
